\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\ul\b\fs22 YORUMUM:\ulnone\b0  Ya\'fea, varol arkada\'fe; eline, diline, y\'fcre\'f0ine sa\'f0l\'fdk! D\'fcn Ortaasya T\'fcrklerini Anadoluya getirip Yahudi \'ddsa-Roma-Bizans\'fdn kar\'fe\'fds\'fdna Osmanl\'fdy\'fd dikip, darmaduman ettirdi. Sonras\'fdnda S\'fcvey\'fe ve Arap petrolleri i\'e7in Osmanl\'fdy\'fd da darmaduman etti. Avrupan\'fdn s\'fcrg\'fcn e\'fek\'fdyas\'fd siyonist-yanki art\'fdk  nazi AB ve masoni\'e7e BK ikilisini takm\'fdyor, Roma-Bizanstan daha azg\'fdnla\'fet\'fd. BK art\'fdk M\'fds\'fdr Sina's\'fdna \'ddsraili haritadan silmeye niyetli \'c7in'i konu\'feland\'fdr\'fdp, azg\'fdn\'fdn burnunu s\'fcrtsem mi diye d\'fc\'fe\'fcnmekte...\lang1033\f1\par
